cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AnalogRF-IR in academic work, cite the repository for now and update to the manuscript or preprint citation when available."
type: software
title: "AnalogRF-IR: Evidence-Gated Causal Diagnosis for Simulator-Backed OTA Optimization"
authors:
  - name: "AnalogRF-IR Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yixin-Gong/AnalogRF-IR"
abstract: "AnalogRF-IR is a simulator-backed analog circuit optimization framework for topology-aware OTA sizing using typed YAML schemas, G_m/I_D-guided surrogate search, NSGA-II exploration, ngspice validation, causal diagnosis, LLM-guided diagnosis, and evidence-gated action application."
keywords:
  - analog-circuit-design
  - open-pdk
  - ihp-sg13g2
  - llm-eda
  - gm-id
  - nsga-ii
  - ngspice
